# group<TAB>component - taken from the Infamick Magisk script's GMS list
# (github.com/Infamousmick/Infamick-script), regrouped so each feature is opt-in.
# Group "" entries were dropped on purpose: chimera (GMS intent/push core),
# phenotype (Play Services flag config) and config checkin.
